### 6. How Running is Handled (The "Tick" Loop)
The Tree doesn't run once—it **ticks every frame**. The **Move Action** returns `RUNNING` until complete.

```
                     FRAME 1                      FRAME 2
                        │                           │
                        ▼                           ▼
              ┌───────────────────┐       ┌───────────────────┐
              │ Tree Ticks        │       │ Tree Ticks Again  │
              │ Flee Seq:         │       │ Flee Seq:         │
              │  - Cond: Success  │       │  - Cond: Success  │
              │  - Calc: Success  │       │  - Calc: Success  │
              │  - Move: RUNNING  │──────▶│  - Move: RUNNING  │ (still moving)
              └───────────────────┘       └───────────────────┘
                                                    │
                                                    ▼ (after 3 seconds)
                                              ┌───────────────────┐
                                              │ Move: SUCCESS     │
                                              │ Sequence ends.    │
                                              │ Tree goes back to │
                                              │ Selector.         │
                                              └───────────────────┘
```

---

### 7. The "Forget" Mechanism (Resetting)
To stop the NPC from fleeing forever, you add a **Cooldown Decorator** or a **Timeout Condition**.

```
                    ┌──────────────────────────────────┐
                    │  SEQUENCE (Flee Branch)         │
                    └───────────────┬──────────────────┘
                                    │
                                    ▼
                    ┌──────────────────────────────────┐
                    │  DECORATOR: Cooldown (5 sec)    │  (Wraps the Condition)
                    │  (Allows re-check only after    │
                    │   5s have passed)               │
                    └───────────────┬──────────────────┘
                                    │
                                    ▼
                    ┌──────────────────────────────────┐
                    │  LEAF: Condition                │
                    │  "Is Threat Detected?"          │
                    └──────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Result:** After fleeing, the Condition won't re-trigger for 5 seconds—giving the NPC time to calm down and return to Patrol.

